WEBVTT

00:00:00.195 --> 00:00:03.985
When your customer comes to pay, tap <b>Cobrar crédito</b> (collect credit)

00:00:04.035 --> 00:00:07.827
Choose your customer: here you see how much they owe in total

00:00:07.893 --> 00:00:12.483
There are <b>two ways to collect</b>: <b>Liquidar todo</b> (pay it all off) at once…

00:00:12.535 --> 00:00:18.165
…or <b>one ticket at a time</b>, if they are paying for just one purchase or paying part

00:00:18.215 --> 00:00:22.967
Today they pay it all: tap <b>Liquidar todo</b> (pay it all off)

00:00:23.011 --> 00:00:28.962
The amount is the sum of all their balances; enter how much they hand you to see the change

00:00:29.014 --> 00:00:35.525
Collect it: <b>a single receipt</b> comes out with all their tickets, and your customer owes nothing
